   ],
   "textLength": 303,
   "text": "Fattoush is a salad from the Levant region, which includes several countries in the Eastern Mediterranean. This salad commonly includes fresh veggies and herbs, toasted or fried flatbread, and a bright spice called sumac. Pomegranate molasses is another common ingredient that adds even more brightness.",
